# ==============================================================================
# 1. HAPPY PATH (CRUD Lifecycle con Request Chaining)
# ==============================================================================

### 1.1 List all tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 1.2 Create a new task (USER role)
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-role: USER

{
  "title": "Aprender Request Chaining",
  "description": "Automatizar flujos de prueba en VS Code REST Client",
  "userId": "{{validUserId}}"
}

### Extraer dinámicamente el ID generado para las siguientes peticiones
@createdTaskId = {{createTask.response.body.id}}

### 1.3 Get created task by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{createdTaskId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 1.4 Replace task (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{createdTaskId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-role: USER

{
  "userId": "{{validUserId}}",
  "title": "Aprender Request Chaining (Completado)",
  "description": "Automatización exitosa sin copiar UUIDs",
  "completed": true
}

### 1.5 Partial update task (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{createdTaskId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-role: USER

{
  "completed": false
}

### 1.6 Delete created task (ADMIN role required)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{createdTaskId}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-role: ADMIN

# ==============================================================================
# 2. SECURITY & AUTHORIZATION MATRIX (Guards Verification: 401 / 403)
# ==============================================================================

### 2.1 Request sin x-api-key -> 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### 2.2 Request con x-api-key inválida -> 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
x-api-key: invalid-secret-key

### 2.3 Rol VIEWER intentando crear tarea -> 403 Forbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-role: VIEWER

{
  "title": "Intento no autorizado",
  "userId": "{{validUserId}}"
}

### 2.4 Rol USER intentando borrar tarea -> 403 Forbidden
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/dc15f411-3770-420c-9d4e-1f670524ae48
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-role: USER

# ==============================================================================
# 3. DOMAIN VALIDATION & ERROR HANDLING (Pipes & Filters: 400 / 404)
# ==============================================================================

### 3.1 ID no es UUID válido -> 400 Bad Request (ParseUUIDPipe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/invalid-uuid-format
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 3.2 Tarea no encontrada -> 404 Not Found (UUID generado al vuelo con {{$guid}})
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{$guid}}
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### 3.3 Creación con usuario inexistente -> 404 Not Found (UUID aleatorio para userId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-role: USER

{
  "title": "Tarea sin dueño real",
  "userId": "{{$guid}}"
}

# ==============================================================================
# 4. UNHANDLED EXCEPTIONS (Global Exception Filter: 500)
# ==============================================================================
### 4.1 Error de validacion (400 bad request con array de errores)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-role: USER

{
  "invalidField": "invalidValue"
}

### 4.2 Error no manejado (500 Internal Server Error)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/simulation/unhandled-error
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

# =============================================================================
# 5. CUSTOM PARAM DECORATORS (RequestUser & ClientIp Decorators)
# =============================================================================
### 5.1 Obtener perfil e IP
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/me
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-role: USER

### 5.2 Obtener perfil con proxy simulado (x-forwarded-for)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/me
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
x-user-role: ADMIN
x-forwarded-for: 203.0.113.195, 70.41.3.18